<p>Pricing changes frequently and varies by region, contact volume, and contract term, so check the official pricing pages of every shortlisted app and model an eighteen-month total that includes a peak season. Segmentation free tiers look generous until one limit bites — verify which of contacts, sends, branching, or support constrains segmentation first.</p>
